# ============================================================
# P204B — Data Hygiene Hardening (2026-07-20)
# Policy: NO production/staging data, NO generated pipeline
# outputs, NO backups, NO runtime artifacts, NO mr-kep
# execution data in Git.
# PRESERVED: source, tests, schemas, intentional design
# docs, reusable config (never ignored below).
# ============================================================

